\b Spyglass MSI Probe (test package)\b0\par
\par
This small package tests whether Windows lists an app installed with Windows Installer (.msi) in the Start menu and in Settings > Installed apps.\par
\par
It installs one small program and one Start-menu entry, for your user only, without administrator rights. It changes nothing in Spyglass and collects nothing.\par
\par
Uninstall it from Settings > Installed apps when the test is done.\par
}
